#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/library.js:19
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "MISTY LAKE LIBRARY"
msgstr "MISTY LAKE LIBRARY / 霧湖圖書館"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/library.js:19
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "Books need not be quiet. Their circulation records do."
msgstr "書不一定安靜，但借閱紀錄必須說得清楚。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/library.js:19
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"Search the collection, borrow available books, place holds on items that are "
"checked out or temporarily off the shelf, and renew loans before they are "
"due. Every action stays on this device."
msgstr "搜尋館藏、借出在架書、為外借或離架中的書排隊，並在期限內續借。所有操作只保存在這台裝置。"

